#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A guide for teams and organizations in the early stages of quantum initiative development."
msgstr "Un guide pour les équipes et organisations aux premiers stades du développement d'une initiative quantique."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is designed to assist teams and organizations to effectively build the necessary capabilities to successfully kick-start quantum initiatives. \n"
msgstr "Ce cours est conçu pour aider les équipes et les organisations à développer efficacement les capacités nécessaires pour lancer avec succès des initiatives quantiques. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend devoting approximately 4 hours to completing this content, depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr "Nous recommandons de consacrer environ 4 heures à la réalisation de ce contenu, selon ton expérience préalable.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Intended audience {#intended-audience}"
msgstr "Public cible {#intended-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend this course for leaders and architects of quantum initiatives, including academic faculty, project leaders in large enterprises, startup leadership, and more. It will be of particular use to organizations new to quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Nous recommandons ce cours aux responsables et aux architectes d'initiatives quantiques, notamment aux professeurs d'université, aux chefs de projet dans les grandes entreprises, aux dirigeants de startups, et plus encore. Il sera particulièrement utile aux organisations qui découvrent l'informatique quantique.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Prérequis recommandés {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is no technical prerequisite for this course, but we recommend that learners first take the [Quantum Business Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations) course, which is a good introduction to the quantum ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de prérequis technique pour ce cours, mais nous recommandons que les apprenants suivent d'abord le cours [Quantum Business Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations), qui constitue une bonne introduction à l'écosystème quantique.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have questions or concerns regarding this course, please contact the IBM Quantum Learning&reg; team.\n"
msgstr "Si tu as des questions ou des préoccupations concernant ce cours, contacte l'équipe IBM Quantum Learning&reg;.\n"
